## Overall definition of done

- I can ask a real question in Arabic or English, scoped to one country, and get an
  answer with citations I can verify in the official source
- The system refuses rather than inventing, every time
- Repealed text never appears as current law
- The eval harness lets me change things without breaking them blind
- Every answer makes clear this is research assistance, not legal advice

