## How to work with me

Explain tradeoffs before implementing. When something is likely to fail — Arabic OCR
quality, article parsing edge cases, embedding recall on legal Arabic, amendment
chains that don't resolve cleanly — say so upfront rather than after I've built on top
of it. Push back if I ask for something that adds complexity without evidence it's
needed. Stop at each phase gate and show me the numbers.